  "body": "Calling retirees, investors, and families wanting an easy-care home so they have more time to enjoy life and the surrounding boating and outdoor lifestyle Gulf Harbour has to offer! \r\n\r\nSet on a sunny street in the heart of Gulf Harbour, this single-level brick and weatherboard home makes everyday life easy. Only a short stroll to drop the kids or grandkiddies off at Gulf Harbour Primary or Wentworth Private School and enjoy a morning coffee on the way home, this immaculate home is a must-see!\r\n\r\nWith three good-sized bedrooms and two bathrooms, there's plenty of space without anything feeling overdone. The main bedroom includes a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the rest of the house is complemented by a second bathroom and separate toilet.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen connects seamlessly with the living space, opening out to a covered patio and fully fenced flat lawn, an easy spot for morning coffees, summer dinners or keeping an eye on the kids. Good parking and an internal-access double garage complete the picture.\r\n\r\nAnd when it comes to location, you're well looked after. The Gulf Harbour Marina, local shops, Four Square and restaurants are all close by, with plenty of options for grabbing a coffee, heading out for dinner or picking up the essentials. Add in the choice of beaches, coastal spots and scenic walks right on your doorstep, and it's easy to see why this is such a popular place to call home.\r\n\r\nA home that offers comfort, convenience and a little bit of that laid-back Gulf Harbour lifestyle.",
